WEBVTT

00:09:28.522 --> 00:09:31.150
And some of it is for personal reasons.

00:09:32.109 --> 00:09:33.902
This is still very raw for me.

00:09:42.745 --> 00:09:46.081
I never imagined

00:09:46.081 --> 00:09:49.835
Afghanistan would fall as fast as it did.

00:09:54.506 --> 00:09:55.883
No one imagined it.

00:09:57.968 --> 00:09:59.678
But I will tell you this.